# Vercel uploads the whole repo for CLI deploys; the songnest project only
# builds crates/accounts (Root Directory). Exclude everything the Rust
# builder never touches so uploads stay small and fast.
# NOTE: crates/** must stay (cargo workspace resolution needs every member
# manifest), as must the root Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock.
web/
site/
music/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.log
cookies*.txt
